  texts:
  - key: PIO.01.01
    group: narrative
    ptText: Em 1972, uma pequena sonda partiu para os planetas exteriores.
    enText: In 1972, a small spacecraft set out for the outer planets.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.01.02
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Seu destino era J\xFApiter. Ningu\xE9m havia explorado aquele mundo de perto."
    enText: Its destination was Jupiter. No one had explored that world up close.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.01.03
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Em menos de 11 horas, j\xE1 havia cruzado a \xF3rbita da Lua."
    enText: "In less than 11 hours, it had crossed the Moon\u2019s orbit."
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.01.04
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Girar ajudava a manter a sonda est\xE1vel durante a viagem."
    enText: Spinning helped keep the spacecraft stable during its journey.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.01.05
    group: narrative
    ptText: Longe do Sol, seus geradores transformavam calor radioativo em eletricidade.
    enText: Far from the Sun, its generators turned radioactive heat into electricity.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.02.01
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Entre Marte e J\xFApiter, o cintur\xE3o de asteroides guardava uma d\xFAvida."
    enText: Between Mars and Jupiter, the asteroid belt held an unanswered question.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.02.02
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Haveria part\xEDculas suficientes para danificar a sonda?"
    enText: Would there be enough particles to damage the spacecraft?
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.02.03
    group: narrative
    ptText: Imagine o medo de encontrar um caminho cheio de pedras...
    enText: Imagine the fear of finding a path crowded with rocks...
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.02.04
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Mas a travessia real n\xE3o foi um labirinto. Os asteroides estavam muito distantes."
    enText: But the real crossing was not a maze. The asteroids were very far apart.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.02.05
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Os instrumentos procuravam algo menor: part\xEDculas de poeira."
    enText: 'The instruments searched for something smaller: dust particles.'
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.02.06
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Ap\xF3s meses de medi\xE7\xF5es, a Pioneer saiu do cintur\xE3o sem danos."
    enText: After months of measurements, Pioneer emerged from the belt undamaged.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.03.01
    group: narrative
    ptText: "No fim de 1973, J\xFApiter come\xE7ou a encher o quadro."
    enText: By late 1973, Jupiter began to fill the frame.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.03.02
    group: narrative
    ptText: Cada mensagem levava dezenas de minutos. A equipe precisava planejar antes.
    enText: Each message took tens of minutes. The team had to plan ahead.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.03.03
    group: narrative
    ptText: Para ver esse mundo, uma imagem teria de nascer aos poucos.
    enText: To see this world, an image would have to emerge a little at a time.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.04.01
    group: narrative
    ptText: "A Pioneer n\xE3o tinha uma c\xE2mera como a de um celular."
    enText: Pioneer did not have a camera like the one in a phone.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.04.02
    group: narrative
    ptText: "A rota\xE7\xE3o varria o planeta. Faixas estreitas formavam a imagem."
    enText: Its spin scanned the planet. Narrow strips built the image.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.04.03
    group: narrative
    ptText: O instrumento media luz vermelha e azul.
    enText: The instrument measured red and blue light.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.04.04
    group: narrative
    ptText: "A radia\xE7\xE3o de J\xFApiter provocou comandos indevidos no instrumento."
    enText: "Jupiter\u2019s radiation triggered unwanted commands in the instrument."
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.04.05
    group: narrative
    ptText: "A equipe enviou sequ\xEAncias de recupera\xE7\xE3o. A observa\xE7\xE3o continuou."
    enText: The team sent recovery sequences. The observations continued.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.04.06
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Na Terra, o processamento estimava tamb\xE9m o verde e compunha a imagem."
    enText: On Earth, processing also estimated green and assembled the image.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.04.07
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Algumas imagens se perderam, inclusive a de Io. Mas muito chegou at\xE9 n\xF3s."
    enText: "Some images were lost, including Io\u2019s. But so much reached us."
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.04.08
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Esta \xE9 Ganimedes, vista pela Pioneer 10 em 1973."
    enText: This is Ganymede, seen by Pioneer 10 in 1973.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.04.09
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Luz, radia\xE7\xE3o e magnetismo: um mundo novo para estudar."
    enText: 'Light, radiation and magnetism: a new world to study.'
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.05.01
    group: narrative
    ptText: "A sonda levava outra coisa: uma apresenta\xE7\xE3o de quem a construiu."
    enText: 'The spacecraft carried something else: an introduction to its makers.'
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.05.02
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Hidrog\xEAnio: uma refer\xEAncia para medir tempo e tamanho."
    enText: 'Hydrogen: a reference for measuring time and size.'
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.05.03
    group: narrative
    ptText: 'Pulsares: estrelas que ajudam a localizar o nosso Sol.'
    enText: 'Pulsars: stars that help locate our Sun.'
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.05.04
    group: narrative
    ptText: "O terceiro planeta \xE9 a origem da viagem: a Terra."
    enText: 'The third planet is where the journey began: Earth.'
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.05.05
    group: narrative
    ptText: "A pr\xF3pria Pioneer d\xE1 uma escala para os desenhos humanos."
    enText: Pioneer itself provides a scale for the human figures.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.05.06
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Pessoas: uma delas ergue a m\xE3o, como quem diz ol\xE1."
    enText: 'People: one raises a hand, as if to say hello.'
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.05.07
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Uma placa de alum\xEDnio dourado. Uma mensagem para um encontro que talvez nunca aconte\xE7a."
    enText: A gold-colored aluminum plaque. A message for a meeting that may never happen.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.06.01
    group: narrative
    ptText: "A viagem n\xE3o terminou em J\xFApiter. Sua gravidade mudou o caminho da Pioneer."
    enText: "The journey did not end at Jupiter. Its gravity changed Pioneer\u2019s path."
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.06.02
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Em 1983, ela j\xE1 seguia al\xE9m das \xF3rbitas dos planetas."
    enText: "By 1983, it was traveling beyond the planets\u2019 orbits."
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.06.03
    group: narrative
    ptText: Com os anos, os geradores forneciam menos energia. Era preciso escolher o que manter ligado.
    enText: As years passed, the generators supplied less power. The team had to choose what stayed on.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.06.04
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Em 1998, a Voyager 1 se tornou a mais distante do Sol, seguindo outra dire\xE7\xE3o."
    enText: In 1998, Voyager 1 became the farthest from the Sun, traveling in another direction.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.06.05
    group: narrative
    ptText: A Pioneer havia mostrado o caminho. Agora, a Terra escutava cada vez mais longe.
    enText: Pioneer had shown the way. Now Earth was listening farther and farther away.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.07.01
    group: narrative
    ptText: "A dist\xE2ncia aumentava. As antenas da Terra buscavam um sinal cada vez mais fraco."
    enText: "The distance grew. Earth\u2019s antennas searched for an ever weaker signal."
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.07.02
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Mar\xE7o de 2002. Trinta anos depois do lan\xE7amento, ela ainda respondia."
    enText: March 2002. Thirty years after launch, it was still responding.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.07.03
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Abril de 2002. Os \xFAltimos dados de seus instrumentos chegaram \xE0 Terra."
    enText: April 2002. The last data from its instruments reached Earth.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.07.04
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Janeiro de 2003. Um \xFAltimo sinal levou 11 horas e 20 minutos para chegar."
    enText: January 2003. A last signal took 11 hours and 20 minutes to arrive.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.07.05
    group: narrative
    ptText: Fevereiro de 2003. Nenhum sinal detectado.
    enText: February 2003. No signal detected.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.07.06
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Sem energia suficiente para nos alcan\xE7ar, a Pioneer ficou em sil\xEAncio."
    enText: Without enough power to reach us, Pioneer fell silent.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.08.01
    group: narrative
    ptText: "O sil\xEAncio n\xE3o interrompeu a viagem."
    enText: Silence did not stop the journey.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.08.02
    group: narrative
    ptText: "A Pioneer segue na dire\xE7\xE3o de Aldebaran, uma estrela distante."
    enText: Pioneer continues in the direction of Aldebaran, a distant star.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.08.03
    group: narrative
    ptText: "Estamos falando de milh\xF5es de anos. Um futuro que ningu\xE9m aqui ver\xE1."
    enText: We are talking about millions of years. A future none of us here will see.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.08.04
    group: narrative
    ptText: Quem vai primeiro abre caminho para muitos.
    enText: Those who go first open a path for many.
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.UI.start
    group: hud
    ptText: "Pioneer 10 \xB7 Abrir caminho"
    enText: "Pioneer 10 \xB7 Going first"
    ptStatus: approved
    enStatus: approved
  - key: PIO.UI.dossier
    group: hud
